1) Descriptive Statistics
Mean
$$ \bar{x}=\frac{\sum x_i}{n} $$
Range
$$ Range=Max-Min $$
Population Variance
$$ \sigma^2=\frac{\sum (x_i-\mu)^2}{N} $$
Sample Variance
$$ s^2=\frac{\sum (x_i-\bar{x})^2}{n-1} $$
Standard Deviation

Population:

$$ \sigma=\sqrt{\frac{\sum(x_i-\mu)^2}{N}} $$

Sample:

$$ s=\sqrt{\frac{\sum(x_i-\bar{x})^2}{n-1}} $$
IQR
$$ IQR=Q_3-Q_1 $$
Outlier Limits

Lower Fence:

$$ Q_1-1.5(IQR) $$

Upper Fence:

$$ Q_3+1.5(IQR) $$

القيمة خارج الحدود دي تعتبر Outlier.

Relative Frequency
$$ Relative\ Frequency=\frac{Frequency}{n} $$

ولو Percentage:

$$ Relative\ Frequency\%=\frac{Frequency}{n}\times100 $$
Normal Distribution Rule
$$ \mu\pm1\sigma \approx 68\% $$ $$ \mu\pm2\sigma \approx 95\% $$ $$ \mu\pm3\sigma \approx 99.7\% $$

2) Probability
Basic Probability
$$ P(E)=\frac{\text{Favourable Outcomes}}{\text{Total Outcomes}} $$

ودائمًا:

$$ 0\le P(E)\le1 $$
Complement
$$ P(E^c)=1-P(E) $$
Addition Rule — OR
$$ P(A\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\cap B) $$

لو الأحداث Mutually Exclusive:

$$ P(A\cap B)=0 $$

إذن:

$$ P(A\cup B)=P(A)+P(B) $$
Multiplication Rule — AND
$$ P(A\cap B)=P(A)\times P(B|A) $$

لو Independent:

$$ P(A\cap B)=P(A)\times P(B) $$
Conditional Probability
$$ P(A|B)=\frac{P(A\cap B)}{P(B)} $$

3) Bayes' Theorem
$$ P(A|B)=\frac{P(B|A)\times P(A)}{P(B)} $$

احفظها:

$$ Posterior=\frac{Likelihood\times Prior}{Evidence} $$

4) Central Limit Theorem

توزيع متوسطات العينات:

$$ \bar{x}\sim N\left(\mu,\frac{\sigma^2}{n}\right) $$

وغالبًا في الملف:

$$ n\ge30 $$
Standard Error

لو \(\sigma\) معلومة:

$$ SE=\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt n} $$

لو بنستخدم Sample Standard Deviation:

$$ SE=\frac{s}{\sqrt n} $$

5) Z-Score للـSample Mean
$$ z=\frac{\bar{x}-\mu}{\sigma/\sqrt n} $$

أو في Hypothesis Testing:

$$ z=\frac{\bar{x}-\mu_0}{\sigma/\sqrt n} $$
6) Confidence Interval
لو Population Standard Deviation معلوم
$$ CI=\bar{x}\pm z^*\frac{\sigma}{\sqrt n} $$
لو غير معلوم
$$ CI=\bar{x}\pm t^*\frac{s}{\sqrt n} $$
Margin of Error
$$ ME=z^*\times SE $$

وبالتالي:

$$ CI=\bar{x}\pm ME $$
أشهر قيم \(z^*\)
Confidence	\(z^*\)
90%	1.645
95%	1.960
99%	2.576

7) Hypothesis Testing
Z-Test
$$ z=\frac{\bar{x}-\mu_0}{\sigma/\sqrt n} $$
T-Test
$$ t=\frac{\bar{x}-\mu_0}{s/\sqrt n} $$
Degrees of Freedom
$$ df=n-1 $$
Decision باستخدام p-value

لو:

$$ p<\alpha $$

إذن:

$$ Reject\ H_0 $$

ولو:

$$ p\ge\alpha $$

إذن:

$$ Fail\ to\ Reject\ H_0 $$

8) Type I / Type II Errors
Type I Error
$$ \alpha=P(Reject\ H_0|H_0\ True) $$

يعني False Positive.

Type II Error
$$ \beta=P(Fail\ to\ Reject\ H_0|H_0\ False) $$

يعني False Negative.

Statistical Power
$$ Power=1-\beta $$

9) Regression
Simple Linear Regression
$$ \hat{y}=\beta_0+\beta_1X $$

وفي صيغة الملف:

$$ \hat{y}=\beta_0+\beta_1X+\epsilon $$

حيث:

\(\beta_0\) = Intercept
\(\beta_1\) = Slope
\(\epsilon\) = Error
Multiple Linear Regression
$$ \hat{y}=\beta_0+\beta_1X_1+\beta_2X_2+\cdots $$
Logistic Regression
$$ P(Y=1)=\frac{1}{1+e^{-z}} $$
Polynomial Regression
$$ \hat{y}=\beta_0+\beta_1X+\beta_2X^2 $$
Poisson Regression
$$ \log(\lambda)=\beta_0+\beta_1X $$

أهم القوانين للحفظ السريع
